
:: ChoubolitStruggle2
<<set $textChunks to [
  "The storyteller and necklace continue their infuriating debate, going in circles, missing the OBVIOUS truth.",
  "Chouboli's breathing quickens. Her nails dig into her palms. The words are RIGHT THERE, burning in her throat.",
  "**Chouboli's thoughts:**",
  "*How can they not see?! The SETHANI risked everything for truth! She's the one who—no. NO. Silence. I must maintain silence. This is a trick. This storyteller is TRYING to make me speak. Stay strong. Stay silent.*",
  "The argument reaches absurd heights. They're saying the THIEF was more honest than the woman who confessed to her husband?!",
  "**Chouboli feels the pressure mounting...**"
]>>
<<set $currentChunk to 0>>

<div id="scene">
  <div id="game-container">
    <img id="background" src="images/background2.jpg">
  </div>
  <div id="dialogue-box" onclick="nextChunk()">
    <div class="struggle-box2">
      <div class="narration-text" id="text-display">$textChunks[$currentChunk]</div>
    </div>

    <span id="next-link" style="display:none;">
      <div class="choice-container2">
        <div class="choice-button">
          [[Stay Silent|ChoubolitStruggle3]]
        </div>
        <div class="choice-button2">
          [[SPEAK|ChobouliFourthSpeech]]
        </div>
      </div>
    </span>
  </div>
</div>

